The request log: what this session asked for, and what was refused
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS SYNOPSIS
\fBrequests\fR [\fB\-s\fR|\fB\-\-session\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-method\fR] [\fB\-\-url\-contains\fR] [\fB\-\-status\fR] [\fB\-\-initiator\fR] [\fB\-\-denied\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-session\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Which session, when more than one is open. A name from `\-\-session` at open time, or an opaque id. Defaults to $H5I_BROWSER_SESSION, then to the session `open` last made
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<SEQ>\fR
Only what happened after this sequence number
.TP
\fB\-\-method\fR \fI<METHOD>\fR
Only this method
.TP
\fB\-\-url\-contains\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Only rows whose URL contains this
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Only responses with this status
.TP
\fB\-\-initiator\fR \fI<KIND>\fR
Only `navigation`, `subresource`, `frame`, `redirect` or `replay`
